ak the weapon or surface.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Q9m3Abq0xPUZ40zg.EKp5irpqgnTwEyjX"},{"_id":"6BA0nR5VEDa0Aw15","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Surface-Bound","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>A living mural can move only along flat surfaces such as floors and walls. This allows it to end its movement wrapped around corners when on a continuous surface.</p>\n<p>If the surface it's on is destroyed (such as a portrait hit by a fireball spell or a puddle being splashed), the mural takes @Damage[10d6[untyped]] damage and is shunted to the nearest flat surface. If there is no flat surface within 5 feet, the living mural is destroyed.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Q9m3Abq0xPUZ40zg.6BA0nR5VEDa0Aw15"},{"_id":"6gBFZhqoL9eg2XDz","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Collective Attack","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The subjects depicted within the living mural all reach out at once to attack. The living mural makes a fist Strike against each target within range.</p>\n<p>These attacks count toward the living mural's multiple attack penalty, but this penalty doesn't increase until after all of the attacks are made.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Q9m3Abq0xPUZ40zg.6gBFZhqoL9eg2XDz"},{"_id":"YE6DApvJToive72E","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Paint the Masses","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The living mural expels a @Template[cone|distance:15] of paint.</p>\n<p>Creatures in the area must succeed at a @Check[reflex|dc:41] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round.</p>\n<p>The living mural can't use Paint the Masses again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Paint the Masses]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Q9m3Abq0xPUZ40zg.YE6DApvJToive72E"},{"_id":"snJ95Lkh1TmrNndQ","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Splash of Color","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>When the living mural hits with a splatter attack, the target is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.XgEqL1kFApUbl5Z2]{Blinded} for 1 round.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":"splash-of-color","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!Q9m3Abq0xPUZ4